            "visibleWhen": {
              "flag": "AGREEMENT_E_SIGN"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "termsBlock",
                "props": {
                  "maxHeight": 360,
                  "body": "This agreement is between you (the Rider) and the fleet operator, facilitated on the EVSEYE platform.\n\n1. Vehicle. The scooter allocated to you remains the property of the fleet operator at all times. You have the right to use it for the duration of your active rental plan and for no other purpose.\n\n2. Rent. Rent is charged according to the plan you selected and is debited on the schedule shown at the time of selection. Rent continues to accrue on days you do not ride unless your plan is a daily plan and you have marked yourself absent before the shift cut-off.\n\n3. Condition. You will return the scooter in the same condition it was allocated to you, allowing for fair wear and tear. Damage caused by negligence, misuse or riding under the influence is recoverable from your security deposit and, if that is insufficient, from your earnings.\n\n4. Insurance. The vehicle carries third-party insurance. Personal accident cover applies only while you are marked present and on an active shift. Your nominee, as declared in this application, is the beneficiary.\n\n5. Traffic offences. Challans issued against the vehicle while it is allocated to you are your responsibility and are deducted from your wallet.\n\n6. Termination. Either party may terminate with 7 days notice. The security deposit is refunded within 7 working days of the vehicle being returned and inspected.\n\n7. Data. Location and telemetry are recorded while the vehicle is switched on, for safety, theft recovery and service scheduling."
                }
              },
